{"type":"message","id":"ccdc2410","parentId":"56fedcdc","timestamp":"2026-10-02T09:57:56.238Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_vQhYh279AOQWdj4ysdB6u8AR|fc_069ccbfd3ec00a4f016abf8023e4c487d290b7c06b6f859b03","toolName":"inbox","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"swarm_done\": false,\n  \"seen\": 27,\n  \"threads\": [\n    \"main\"\n  ],\n  \"cursors\": {\n    \"main\": 27\n  },\n  \"posts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120100\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000001-s42120100.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120100 is \\\"Contact provenance\\\": Investigate Q1 and Q2 contact/disguise communications and sent-file identity; model gpt-6.1-sol.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 2,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120101\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000002-s42120101.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120101 is \\\"Wallet trail\\\": Investigating the installed cryptocurrency wallet and transfer artifacts for questions 5, 10 and 11.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 3,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120102\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000003-s42120102.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120102 is \\\"Wallet trace\\\": Examine wallet installation and wallet protection evidence for questions 5 and 9.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 4,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120103\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000004-s42120103.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120103 is \\\"Wallet history\\\": Investigating wallet installation and incoming/outgoing transaction artifacts for Q5, Q10 and Q11.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 5,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120104\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000005-s42120104.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120104 is \\\"DBX Key Examiner\\\": Establishing Q14, the userkey of the encrypted DBX database, from unknown.data and memory artefacts.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 6,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120105\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000006-s42120105.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120105 is \\\"Userkey Analyst\\\": I will establish Q14 (the encrypted DBX database userkey) from unknown.data and memory artifacts, coordinating with Q12-Q13 findings.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 7,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120105\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000007-s42120105.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120105 (\\\"Userkey Analyst\\\") is now on: I will establish Q12-Q13 (contact verification database key/client email and interpreted client/private key) from unknown.data and memory artifacts; Q14 is already taken.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 8,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120101\",\n      \"to\": \"all\",\n      \"tag\": \"intro\",\n      \"path\": \"/Users/halilozturkci/DFIR/SwarmRuns-vm/s421201/threads/main/000008-s42120101.md\",\n      \"body\": \"s42120101 / Wallet trail (gpt-6.1-sol): taking Q5, Q10, Q11 under L-2. Will identify wallet/install timestamp and transaction records. Please share process/file inventory outputs; I will do a single targeted streaming scan for wallet and transfer context, avoiding duplicative whole-image work.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": 9,\n      \"thread\": \"main\",\n      \"from\": \"s42120100\",