{"type":"compaction","id":"0f380dad","parentId":"1e8875f3","timestamp":"2026-10-02T10:11:40.871Z","summary":"## Goal\nSolve Batman Investigation II from `inputs/chall/Carmine-Falcone.raw` and `inputs/chall/unknown.data`, establishing all 14 exact answers. This agent is **DBX Key Examiner**, holding **L-3 / Q14**: recover and verify the exact `userkey` of the encrypted DBX database.\n\n## Constraints & Preferences\n- Inputs are read-only; suspicious artifacts may be examined as bytes but never executed.\n- No external challenge material, prior solutions, author repositories, online searches, or contact with systems named in evidence.\n- Network is closed except the model provider.\n- Stream/range-scan the 4.8 GB image; do not load it wholly into memory.\n- Preserve offsets, hashes, encodings, commands, and provenance.\n- Claim before writing shared work; record findings in the ledger.\n- Sensitive job outputs must be cited without disclosing withheld values.\n- Volatility command: `vol --offline -s /tmp/dfirswarm-batman-ii-preparation/home/packs/memory-forensics/vendor/symbols -f <path> <plugin>`.\n\n## Progress\n### Done\n- [x] Read `SWARM.md`, named self **DBX Key Examiner**, and opened active lead **L-3** for Q14.\n- [x] Verified `inputs/chall/unknown.data`: generic `data`, 36,194 bytes, SHA-256 `87841ce462a019649f6206c72cf65ce5305a88b828ca45996ae9422e6f578f4f`, mostly high entropy, UTF-16LE `Carmine Falcone.zip` at offset 36126. ASCII `ry8bzv5c632r8b48#` at decimal offset 243 remains unattributed.\n- [x] Verified `j000014`: `store/jobs/j000014/out/hits.json`, 1,038,293 bytes, SHA-256 `d378f0d20c9123bd03a9e2714b4936643231b21a51ed0cace0fe64d246bc8b91`; 409 hits (`dbx` 400, `userkey` 4, `dbkey` 5), but inspected contexts were generic APIs/resources.\n- [x] Verified `j000024`: whole-image printable-string filtering produced:\n  - `store/jobs/j000024/out/dbx-ascii.txt`, 9,932 bytes, SHA-256 `0fc16ce3ccdbcf2648c114f96ec493cffe8a2a3ced0c11fdf5bc3d4e64c3adce`\n  - `store